        "original_id": "828931e8-0feb-5e28-9dae-babf6695589d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bobby Fish, Kyle O'Reilly, Kyle Greenwood, Jimmy Rave, Alex Shelley, Abyss\n- Teams: ReDRagon, The Kings of Wrestling\n- Organizations: WWE, NXT, Ring of Honor\n- Events: Tag Wars, Trios Tournament\n\nFacts:\n- Ring of Honor held Tag Wars, formerly called the Trios Tournament, as a one-night professional wrestling tournament in 2005, 2006, 2010, and 2014.\n- Jimmy Rave, Alex Shelley, and Abyss won Ring of Honor's Tag Wars tournament in 2005.\n- The Kings of Wrestling won Ring of Honor's Tag Wars tournament in 2010.\n- ReDRagon won Ring of Honor's Tag Wars tournament in 2014.\n- Kyle Greenwood was born on March 1, 1987.\n- Kyle Greenwood is a Canadian professional wrestler better known by the ring name Kyle O'Reilly.\n- Kyle O'Reilly was signed to WWE and performed in its developmental brand NXT.\n- ReDRagon is a professional wrestling tag team consisting of Bobby Fish and Kyle O'Reilly.",
